language:
  rust:
    surfaces:
      - path: rust/Cargo.toml
    build_defaults:
      exceptions:
        - clauses: [BD-002, BD-004, BD-008]
          route: tools/dev-fast/config.toml
          adr: docs/adr-012-linux-dev-fast-routing.md
          rationale: >-
            The stable MSRV pin and the published wheels, built in manylinux
            containers that carry no mold, must keep the platform linker and the
            LLVM backend, so the linker, the parallel frontend and Cranelift live
            in an explicit fragment that only the Linux make dev-* routes select.
          review_trigger: >-
            Revisit when the wheel build images carry mold, or when the dev-fast
            nightly or the mold pin moves.
